<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><a href="https://www.relay.fm/intentional/8">On this episode of <em>Intentional AI</em></a>, Chris and I look at how dictation went from a nine-thousand-dollar tool that needed hours of training to something you can whisper into your watch. We compare cloud and local options, including Wispr Flow, MacWhisper, Superwhisper, and Whisper Memos, along with the privacy tradeoffs that come with each.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">We also talk about using your voice to give robots better context, then wrap up with Claude&#8217;s new browser and background computer use.</p>



